01:33:14.960 --> 01:33:17.980
Through us, Ya Allah, clothe your creation.

01:33:18.159 --> 01:33:21.500
Through us, Ya Allah, give shelter to your creation.

01:33:21.679 --> 01:33:25.020
Through us, Ya Allah, be generous to your creation.

01:33:25.199 --> 01:33:28.540
Through us, Ya Allah, give hope to your creation.

01:33:28.639 --> 01:33:32.880
Through us, ya Allah, be merciful to your creation through us.

01:33:32.880 --> 01:33:33.700
Ya Allah,

01:33:34.080 --> 01:33:35.419
love your creation.

01:33:37.120 --> 01:33:40.300
and help us to develop a healthy love of ourselves

01:33:40.719 --> 01:33:45.440
that enables us to go out and try our best every day that we are in

01:33:45.440 --> 01:33:46.340
this world.

01:33:48.080 --> 01:33:52.560
Make us those, ya Allah, who do not live with fear any longer,

01:33:53.760 --> 01:33:58.420
who don't seek to just simply survive in and for this world.

01:33:59.520 --> 01:34:05.920
But help us to be those who empower and strengthen one another to truly honor the

01:34:05.920 --> 01:34:09.320
mam of being a sister and brother to each other

01:34:10.239 --> 01:34:14.239
so that we might build for ourselves what no one else is going to build for

01:34:14.239 --> 01:34:14.639
us.

01:34:15.840 --> 01:34:19.820
The world is filled with so much difficulty, so much distress.

01:34:20.719 --> 01:34:22.600
There are people who we share

01:34:22.960 --> 01:34:27.280
community with who are holding pain that they don't know what to do.

01:34:27.760 --> 01:34:28.220
Help

01:34:28.880 --> 01:34:33.120
us, ya Allah, to be a source of healing and never to be a source of

01:34:33.120 --> 01:34:34.120
harm or hurt.

01:34:34.719 --> 01:34:38.379
And for any one of us who is holding our own difficulty,

01:34:40.400 --> 01:34:43.520
let not any one of us feel alone any longer,

01:34:44.480 --> 01:34:48.140
but bring to us those who will be the best of our helpers and supporters.

01:34:48.800 --> 01:34:52.420
Arrange our hearts with those hearts that are gentle and tender

01:34:54.159 --> 01:34:54.979
and make us

01:34:55.520 --> 01:34:59.180
from amongst those who have the blessings and benefits

01:35:00.000 --> 01:35:01.500
of true companionship

01:35:02.560 --> 01:35:06.260
that helps us to remember who it is that we are supposed to be

01:35:06.800 --> 01:35:10.620
and enables us to get there with kindness and consideration.

01:35:11.920 --> 01:35:13.340
Bless this space, Yub,

01:35:14.080 --> 01:35:19.679
and make the Muslim Wellness Center here in Atlanta a means of benefit for all of

01:35:19.679 --> 01:35:20.620
your creation.

01:35:21.920 --> 01:35:24.939
Bless the leaders, the volunteers, the contributors,

01:35:26.239 --> 01:35:28.360
and help them to grow this place

01:35:29.360 --> 01:35:30.400
in pursuit

01:35:31.120 --> 01:35:32.340
of all things

01:35:32.719 --> 01:35:38.280
that serve as reminders of what this dean is built truly upon.

01:35:39.760 --> 01:35:43.100
Make it a place of replenishment, a place of revitalization,

01:35:43.760 --> 01:35:46.700
a place of growth, a place of healing.

01:35:47.840 --> 01:35:53.440
And never let it be a place where anybody feels any type of pain, hurt or

01:35:53.440 --> 01:35:53.960
harm.

01:35:56.000 --> 01:35:59.740
Forgive us, ya Allah, for anything that we might have done

01:36:00.159 --> 01:36:01.000
to cause

01:36:01.360 --> 01:36:05.339
shortcomings or obstacles in the lives of any of your creation.

01:36:06.960 --> 01:36:09.960
and help us to move forward from this place

01:36:10.719 --> 01:36:14.060
in pursuit of trying nothing other than our very best

01:36:14.880 --> 01:36:17.840
so that when we stand in front of you on that day

01:36:18.480 --> 01:36:22.639
we might be able to say that we've fulfilled the purpose for which it was that

01:36:22.639 --> 01:36:23.680
you created us.

01:36:24.960 --> 01:36:29.099
We ask ya Allah that by the baraka of this gathering you accept our dua.

01:36:29.600 --> 01:36:32.940
That by the presence of the righteous that are here you accept our dua.

01:36:33.199 --> 01:36:37.179
that by the sincerity of the most sincere that are here, you accept our dua.

01:36:37.760 --> 01:36:43.760
Make this community always a means of benefit and blessing for your creation and allow for

01:36:43.760 --> 01:36:48.320
each one of those who come into its doors to be given nothing less than the

01:36:48.320 --> 01:36:50.600
best in this world and the best in the next.

01:36:50.960 --> 01:36:55.520
Protect us always from hearts that are not humble, tongues that are not wise, and eyes

01:36:55.520 --> 01:36:57.099
that have forgotten how to cry.

01:36:57.360 --> 01:37:00.460
Forgive us for our shortcomings and guide and bless us all.
